     2311     end.
     2312     else do:
     2313       assign
     2314         v-change-sign = -1
     2315       .
     2316     end.
     2317     assign
     2318       p-change-value = truncate(abs(p-change-value), 0) * v-change-sign
     2319     .
     2320     if p-change-value = 0
     2321     then do:
